# What plain `docker build` must not send as build context.
#
# Keep this and .maven-dockerignore identical: the Maven one is read only by the fabric8
# docker-maven-plugin, this one only by plain `docker build`, and nothing checks that they
# agree. Without this file the documented no-Maven build --
#
#   docker build -t iap/docling:latest modules/documents/processing
#
# -- shipped target/, the test suite and whatever __pycache__ happened to be lying around into
# the image, including bytecode for modules that no longer exist on the branch.
target/
src/test/
pom.xml
pytest.ini
docker-compose.yml
*.md

# Test byproducts
.pytest_cache/
.coverage

# Never bake bytecode: it is rebuilt in the container anyway, and a stale .pyc is confusing
# at best.
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
